1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Yeah, I know, she was so surprised.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Really?

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,500
Oh, for sure!

4
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:08,500
I mean, it wasn't very big, just a little bug,

5
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,500
but Flower went crazy!

6
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:14,500
OMG, Flower is really afraid of bugs.

7
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:18,500
Well, yeah.
Flower thinks she's so fabulous.

8
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:22,500
Like the time she asked Icy if she was beautiful.

9
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:26,500
Ice Cube, don't you think I look beautiful?

10
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:28,500
Uh, no?

11
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:32,500
Oh, oh! I remember that!

12
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:35,000
I am SO gonna get revenge on her.

13
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,500
I cannot believe how she thinks we will be her servants!

14
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:42,000
I'm so glad you guys are my friends, though.

15
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:46,500
Really!
Bubble likes me too... Right, Bubble?

16
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:49,000
- Uh, um...
- Right?

17
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Yeah?

18
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,000
- No, Ice Cube! Stop!
- No, Ice Cube! Stop!

19
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:54,500
*pop*

20
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Pin, you nearly popped me!

21
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Oh, it's not my fault.
It's this stupid Blocky here. It's his fault!

22
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:05,880
Oof!

23
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:09,500
Fine, I'll get Needle.

24
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:10,500
- Help!
- Yikes!

25
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:14,000
- What was that for?
- Hey, I'm just in the mood to hurt someone.

26
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:19,000
*scream*

27
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:25,000
Woody, get up!
There's a life out there to enjoy, so enjoy it!

28
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:36,000
Teardrop, calm down.

29
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:38,500
Kicking Woody could severely injure him.

30
00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:40,500
He IS balsa.

31
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:54,000
*scream*
- I can't believe what a scaredy-cat Woody is.

32
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:56,560
He's so uncool.

33
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:58,880
Pen, though, you're cool.

34
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:01,000
So're you, Eraser.

35
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:05,000
Oof!

36
00:02:06,300 --> 00:02:09,500
Whoa!
Rocky, wake up!

37
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:13,500
Wha?
Hi, SB

38
00:02:13,500 --> 00:02:15,500
*sigh*

39
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:18,500
Whee!
Oof!

40
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:21,260
Hi, TB, my good-old friend!

41
00:02:28,500 --> 00:02:31,340
Coiny, you're so dumb!

42
00:02:32,500 --> 00:02:38,960
- Hey!
- Oh my gosh, Firey, you're so easy to slap.

43
00:02:39,300 --> 00:02:41,380
*slapping*

44
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:44,500
GB: Firey, Coiny, stop fighting!

45
00:02:44,500 --> 00:02:49,500
And Spongy, take a bath. You're stinky.
Sorry.

46
00:02:49,500 --> 00:02:52,000
Isn't Golf Ball bossy?

47
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:56,500
I know.
She is like a bossy-bot.

48
00:02:57,840 --> 00:03:00,960
Uh, you know, a bossy robot?

49
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:07,500
Well, a robot that was built to be its bossiest.

50
00:03:07,500 --> 00:03:10,500
I'd do anything to get away from her.

51
00:03:10,500 --> 00:03:13,500
Eraser: Or Flower, or Woody, or Spongy.

52
00:03:14,500 --> 00:03:18,000
- Well, then you're in luck.
- Uh, how?

53
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:21,500
Well, everybody, they're building the island of luxury.

54
00:03:21,500 --> 00:03:24,000
Announcer: It's called Dream Island.

55
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:26,439
Announcer: A whole square mile of paradise,

56
00:03:26,439 --> 00:03:29,000
Announcer: a five-star hotel,
a casino,

57
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:31,500
Announcer: six restaurants,
robot servants,

58
00:03:31,500 --> 00:03:35,500
Announcer: and the winner even gets to decide who
gets to come in and who doesn't.

59
00:03:35,500 --> 00:03:39,000
So, um, how much'll it cost?

60
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:41,000
Not even a penny.

61
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:43,000
Then I'll take it!

62
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:46,000
Announcer: But what about everybody else?
They want it too, you know.

63
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:49,000
Uh, I wouldn't give up that island for anything.

64
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:51,000
Neither would they.

65
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:54,000
So we must settle this with a contest.

66
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:07,800
So yes.
Whoever stays on the bar the longest wins.

67
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:12,860
- Let's help each other.
- Yeah!

68
00:04:12,860 --> 00:04:17,000
Blocky, wake up. What are you doing?

69
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:19,000
Uh-oh.

70
00:04:19,820 --> 00:04:23,000
Out of my way! I need my space!

71
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:25,000
Help me, Pin!

72
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:28,000
*Snatch!*
Thanks.

73
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:30,500
Let's form an alliance.

74
00:04:30,500 --> 00:04:34,000
That would do no harm.
Let's do it!

75
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:36,000
IC: Wha?
An alliance?

76
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:38,000
I've got to join.

77
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:41,000
IC: Coming through!
Sorry, Pen.

78
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:44,000
IC: Hey, guys! Can I be part—
*boom*

79
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:46,000
No.

80
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:50,000
Coiny: Blocky, come on. Wake up!

81
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:52,000
Oops.
*Snatch!*

82
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:54,000
Coiny, don't ever—

83
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:57,500
Oops.
*Yeah!*

84
00:04:57,500 --> 00:05:01,000
Leafy: There's the evil Flower. She's still in.

85
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:03,000
Let's run her over!
Yeah!

86
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:05,000
Uh-oh.

87
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:11,000
Hey, we're flying!

88
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:14,000
You're right! Woo-hoo!

89
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:16,000
Uh-oh.

90
00:05:16,860 --> 00:05:18,000
Pull up.

91
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:19,640
I can't!

92
00:05:19,860 --> 00:05:24,500
Leafy: Oh no! Blocky? Rocky? Help!

93
00:05:24,500 --> 00:05:27,000
- What is it?
- Leafy: You're stepping on me.

94
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:30,000
- Better?
- Leafy: Yes. Now pull us up.

95
00:05:32,500 --> 00:05:34,000
- Whoa!
- Ack!

96
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:38,500
- Teardrop, hold onto my other arm.
- Flower: Ha, ha!

97
00:05:38,500 --> 00:05:42,000
I'm wearing non-slip shoes, so ha.

98
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:45,000
Hey! Grr!
*Snatch!*

99
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:47,500
Ack!
Huh, wha—

100
00:05:47,500 --> 00:05:50,500
Ew, oh my god!...

101
00:05:50,500 --> 00:05:52,500
*scream*

102
00:05:52,500 --> 00:05:56,000
Nice going, Pin. A job well done.

103
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:59,000
Teardrop, let's swing.

104
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:02,000
- Yay.
- Pin, alliance, remember?

105
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:06,000
- Oh yeah.
- Blocky: Leafy, you're stepping on me!

106
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:09,000
Wha?
Oops.

107
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:22,500
*Yeah!*

108
00:06:22,500 --> 00:06:25,000
- Rock, paper, scissors.
- Rock, paper, scissors.

109
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:28,500
Scissors beats paper. I get to push you off.

110
00:06:28,500 --> 00:06:32,500
Wait, hold on a sec. We didn't agree to that.

111
00:06:32,500 --> 00:06:36,000
Look, when I win the island, I'll let you onto the island.

112
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:38,500
Leafy: Pin, this still isn't fair.

113
00:06:38,500 --> 00:06:43,000
- Only one of us can win.
- Um, Pin, wrong finger.

114
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,660
Whoops, heh heh.

115
00:06:44,660 --> 00:06:47,500
Anyway, still, only one of us can win.

116
00:06:47,500 --> 00:06:52,000
- That's where you're wrong. The two of you both win.
- Wait, we both get the island?

117
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:54,500
Nope. You just get to choose the teams.

118
00:06:54,500 --> 00:06:58,000
The teams for a much larger, longer battle to win Dream Island.

119
00:06:58,000 --> 00:07:02,000
- Oh, great.
- It's not that bad.